# Keep the upstream PX4 checkout as a separate repository. Track only the
# Polaris-owned setup documentation and launch scripts stored within it.
PX4-Autopilot/*
!PX4-Autopilot/docs/
PX4-Autopilot/docs/*
!PX4-Autopilot/docs/MAC_SIM_SETUP.md
!PX4-Autopilot/scripts/
PX4-Autopilot/scripts/*
!PX4-Autopilot/scripts/start_polaris_sim.sh
!PX4-Autopilot/scripts/stop_polaris_sim.sh
